//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/September_2024_Meiji_Jingu_10.jpg/960px-September_2024_Meiji_Jingu_10.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:September_2024_Meiji_Jingu_10.jpg","by":"Syced","lic":"CC0"}],"jp":"明治神宮"},"Takeshita Street":{"tip":"Арка «Takeshita Street» на входе и радужные крепы в руках.","tag":"takeshitastreet","ph":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Behind_the_%22Takeshita_Street%22_sign_3.jpg/960px-Behind_the_%22Takeshita_Street%22_sign_3.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Behind_the_%22Takeshita_Street%22_sign_3.jpg","by":"Syced","lic":"CC0"}],"jp":"竹下通り"},"Hachiko Memorial Statue":{"tip":"Скрамбл-перекрёсток сверху — со второго этажа Shibuya Stream или Magnet; длинная выдержка вечером.","tag":"shibuyacrossing","ph":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Tokyo_Shibuya_Scramble_Crossing_2018-10-09.jpg/960px-Tokyo_Shibuya_Scramble_Crossing_2018-10-09.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tokyo_Shibuya_Scramble_Crossing_2018-10-09.jpg","by":"Benh LIEU SONG","lic":"CC BY-SA 2.0"},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5d/Shibuya_crossing_seen_from_Shibuya_Stream%2C_2024.jpg/960px-Shibuya_crossing_seen_from_Shibuya_Stream%2C_2024.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shibuya_crossing_seen_from_Shibuya_Stream%2C_2024.jpg","by":"Syced","lic":"CC0"}],"jp":"渋谷スクランブル交差点"},"Shibuya Sky":{"tip":"Угол крыши Sky Edge с городом под ногами на закате — сумки и штативы на крышу не пускают, телефон — можно.","tag":"shibuyasky","ph":[{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Shibuya_Scramble_Square_-_SHIBUYA_SKY_10.jpg/960px-Shibuya_Scramble_Square_-_SHIBUYA_SKY_10.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shibuya_Scramble_Square_-_SHIBUYA_SKY_10.jpg","by":"Kakidai","lic":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Shibuya_Scramble_Square_S